==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 14.67~23.33 seconds<sup>440f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 160 seconds<sup>4,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 213.33 seconds<sup>6,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 286.67 seconds<sup>8,600f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16~18.67 seconds<sup>480f~560f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Baron Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 28.67~32 seconds<sup>860f~960f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 18.67~23.33 seconds<sup>560f~700f</sup>.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 18.67~25.33 seconds<sup>560f~760f</sup>.

